<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Crane Co started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Crane Co started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it started coverage of Crane Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 42-1/2.</p>
</text>
